<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div>Congratulations on your admission to Arizona State University. I am pleased to inform you that you have been selected for our <b>New American University Plus</b> <b>Scholarship</b>!</div><div><br></div><div>This new scholarship will be renewable for three years for a four-year total award. You can review your awards on <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/myasu/">My ASU</a> and learn more about the conditions for renewal on <a href="http://students.asu.edu/scholarships/renewal">ASU's Scholarship Renewal Guide</a>.</div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Please let me know if you have any additional questions about this scholarship or your next steps for enrolling at ASU.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div></div><div><br></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>